{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想再等到心里全明白，便先承担起自己能做的那部分。\",\n      \"key\": \"承担起自己\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果没把握，他不再反复追问值不值得，心里仍有疑虑也肯尽力，行动让他有力气，也有些骄傲。\",\n      \"key\": \"行动让他有力气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他愿意再多给些，尽力本身就让他痛快，心里的不满也总算有了去处。\",\n      \"key\": \"再多给些\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再时时审视自己，偶尔发软也照样往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"照样往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着从前珍惜的东西，如今只能记在心里，不能像过去那样自然拥有。\",\n      \"key\": \"自然拥有\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他努力把失落压下去，反而显出他其实很在意。\",\n      \"key\": \"努力把失落压下去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样垮下去，一再把自己撑起来，可想到放不下的事，劲头又泄了，焦急得安顿不下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"劲头又泄了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不再等到全想明白落到先承担自己能做的部分，保留对前段迟疑的回应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留结果没把握、疑虑仍在、行动带来力量和骄傲，去掉重复的主体性总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-6\", \"S02-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留愿意多给、尽力本身带来痛快、不满有了去处，以及不再时时审视自己、偶尔软弱也继续向前的意思。把两层意思分开，修正有地方使的生硬说法，避免一条过于拥挤。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\", \"S02-4\", \"S02-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"展开并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留高昂中仍有牵挂的矛盾，具体写出珍惜的东西已不能如从前拥有，以及他努力压住失落时反而显出在意。再写出不甘心撑下去却被牵挂打断的焦急，解释段内反复起落。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1c00fb47-fba1-483f-9980-394eb92fdf0c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003256294220Z", "elapsed_seconds": 130.468, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:35:06.785198+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3a8cededae87b62b26419f38d87d22d614aac4ef87c4465f0f1f40af9a5ec74", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude